            <div class="about-copy">
                <p>My background is in Web Technology at Politeknik Brunei, where I developed an interest in the intersection of technology and creativity.</p>
                <p>My interest in the creative field began with photography, design and digital media. Over time, I became curious about how technology could be used to bring creative ideas to life. Through my studies and experiences, I've explored both sides, from developing digital applications and designing interfaces to expressing creativity through photography and visual design.</p>
                <p>I'm someone who enjoys learning, experimenting and discovering new possibilities. I'm particularly interested in exploring digital media and visual storytelling, while continuing to build on the technical foundation I've developed. I hope to keep challenging myself, growing creatively and finding new ways to bring ideas to life.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="about-annotation">A mix of tech & art.</p>
